  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-indent:0px\">\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(Если честно, я понятия не имел, что у меня было в голове, когда я давал этому название. Возможно, это как-то связано с котлами?</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)<br>Для этого ресурс-пака рекомендуется использовать <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur.<br></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Excauldibur добавляет обширную поддержку множества различных модов, около половины из которых используются в моде <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/idas\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dungeons and Structures</a> (одном из моих любимых модов всех времён, добавляющем разнообразные красивые структуры с использованием блоков, сущностей и предметов из разных модов), поскольку несколько модов из этого списка — одни из немногих, используемых в IDAS, для которых ещё не существовало ресурс-пака в тематике Excalibur. (Посмотрите ресурс-паки от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/oni7suka/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">oni7suKa</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">GrandPappyJay</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rusekki/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ruseki</a>, и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">TC_</a> для гораздо большей поддержки модов! (Также загляните на <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" rel=\"nofollow\">официальный Discord Excalibur</a>&nbsp;, чтобы найти большой ресурс-пак, содержащий подборку паков поддержки модов для 1.20.1, созданных другими фанатами Excalibur!))<br>На данный момент в этом пакете поддерживаются следующие моды:<br><br></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Supplementaries </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(в разработке</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Cardiac</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-particle-weather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Biome Particle Weather (в разработке)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/luckytnt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Lucky TNT Mod </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(Too Much TNT</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">) </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(Только переделаны текстуры руд</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">RPGHUD </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(Пока очень базовый.</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/box-of-horrors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Box of Horrors </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(в разработке</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/habitat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Habitat</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherific\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Phantasmic</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">/Netherific</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">/Nourished Nether</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/estrogen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Create</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">: Estrogen</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trials-chambers-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Trial Chamber Backport</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.375rem;text-indent:0px\"><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-archeology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">Better Archeology </span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">(в разработке</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
